      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imbūri yo ku kiyaya c’ ukwerekwa. Noneh’ ubaye ute, abantu bawe bose ko būriye ku mazu hejuru? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wewe wuzuye urwamo, wa murwa w’imivurungano, wa gisagara cihaya, abishwe bo mu bawe kw atar’ abishwe n’inkota, kandi ntibagwe mu rugamba! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abākuganza bose ko bahungiye hamwe, bagafatanwa imiheto, kand’ abahizi bawe bose bakaba bafatiwe mpiri hamwe, naho bāri bahungiye kure! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.9.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 9:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubg’ ivyo ndavuga, nti Ni murābe irya, munkūrekw amaso, mureke ndire nitunturire; ntimwigore ngo muranyirura umubabaro mfitiye ukunyagwa kw’i Yerusalemu umukobga w’ubgoko bgacu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.2.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 2:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kukw ar’ umusi w’ubgihebure n’ugusiribangwa n’ukuzazanirwa, uvuye ku Mwami, Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo, mu kiyaya co kwerekwa; hariho gusangangura inzitiro z’amabuye, n’ amaruru ashika ku misozi miremire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abelamu bapfukūye imitana, Abaramu baje bagendera ku mafarasi, kand’ ab’i Kiri basokoroye inkinzo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze mu biyaya vyawe vyiza‐vyiza huzuramw’ imikogote, kand’ abagendera ku mafarasi batonda urugamba kw irembo ry’igisagara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.7.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 7:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.10.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "10:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agukūrakw igitwikirizo, yewe Yuda, ng’ uve i marwi; maz’ uwo musi ujarajara ibirwanishwa vyo mu nzu yitwa iy’ Ikibira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Iyo",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "nzu yitwa iy’ Ikibira",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "n’uko yarimw’ inkingi z’ubushakākwe: rāba",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.7.2+1KI.7.3+1KI.7.4+1KI.7.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 7:2-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.32.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 32:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.3.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 3:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubona ibirengero vy’ibizitiriye umurwa wa Dawidi kw ari vyinshi; mugomera amazi yo mu kidengeri co hepfo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muharūra amazu y’i Yerusalemu, amazu muyasambura kugira ngo mukomeze uruzitiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
