            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.5.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 5:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amazi yo mu kidengeri ca kera muyacira urugomero hagati y’inzitiro zompi: ariko ntimwasubiza ijisho ku wari yarakoze ivyo, kandi ntimwashira umutima ku wabiremye kera cane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kur’ uwo musi Umwami Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo yahamagariye abantu kwiririra no kwiborogera no kwimosha inkomvorera no gukenyera amagunira: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.56.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 56:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.15.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 15:32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yamara bashiraho kwinezereza no guhimbarwa, kubāga inka no kubāga intama, kurya inyama no kunywa vino: bati Ngo twīrīre, twinywere, kukw ejo tuzopfa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.3.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 3:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo yihishurira mu matwi yanje, arambgira, ati N’ukuri, ivyo bigabitanyo ntimuzopfa muvyogejwe ngo bibaveko, ni k’Umwami Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo agize.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.22.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
